!PADS-POWERPCB-V9.5-MILS!
*PART*
U1 STM32F103C8T6
J1 MOTOR_LEFT
J2 MOTOR_RIGHT
J3 VISION_UART
J4 SONAR
*NET*
*SIGNAL* LEFT_PWM
U1.10 J1.1
*SIGNAL* LEFT_DIRECTION
U1.11 J1.2
*SIGNAL* RIGHT_PWM
U1.12 J2.1
*SIGNAL* RIGHT_DIRECTION
U1.13 J2.2
*SIGNAL* VISION_TX
U1.30 J3.1
*SIGNAL* VISION_RX
U1.31 J3.2
*SIGNAL* SONAR_TRIG
U1.18 J4.1
*SIGNAL* SONAR_ECHO
U1.19 J4.2
*END*
